WEBVTT

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.420
Hi! Lina Inverse here.
The beautiful sorcery genius.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.020
Or at least that
what I USED to be...

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.160
...but thanks to a Monster's spell,
I've lost my powers!

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:42.570
Also, while traveling to see some great
sorcery doctor to get my powers back...

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.840
...l've picked up Xellos and, strangely
enough, Martina as traveling companions!

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.840
Martina, you would take advantage
of my not having any powers!

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:52.850
So, we finally got to the sorcery doctor
and they turned out to be a little kid!

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.880
My first thought was
"Am I SURE I want to do this?"...

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.350
...and, naturally, trying to restore
my powers turned into a fiasco.

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.480
On top of that,
a Monster showed up!

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.520
However, I managed to get some
magical talismen from Xellos...

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:04.790
...which amplify magic powers...

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:06.420
...and then came the real shocker:

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.860
This is a Claire Bible manuscript!

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.150
I don't believe
I found the Claire Bible!

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:33.920
This must be heaven's way of making
up for what's happened to me!

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.720
What's a "Claire Bible"?

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:40.090
You need to ask? It's a book
on how to play the ukelele!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:43.390
You shouldn't lie.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:47.540
Why don't I give you a little
lesson about what the Claire Bible is.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.700
Okay, Master Xellos!

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:55.870
The Claire Bible... It's a
legend imparted to this world.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:03:00.780
A legendary book of sorcery
which faithfully records...

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:04.120
...the secrets of sorcery unknown
to us by the Dark Lords...

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:08.150
...and Monsters
of the netherworld.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.390
THAT is the Claire Bible.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.800
Well, so we've actually found a
real copy of the Claire Bible.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:22.330
I suppose you could
say this is lucky.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.540
Hmm, it's written in runes.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:32.550
Just what I'd expect from
the legendary Claire Bible.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.580
Anyway, what does this say?

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.190
This... It can't be!
It is! It definitely is!

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:48.360
It's a technique described
that would be as powerful...

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.960
...an attack spell
as the Giga Slave!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.570
You really seem
interested by that, Miss Lina.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.610
For heaven's sake,
her expression changes so much...

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.610
...when she gets a
look at something valuable.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.700
You hate greedy women like her,
don't you, Master Xellos?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.890
Curse you, Lina Inverse!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:20.920
How dare you distract
my beloved Xellos from me!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:28.500
With this, I'll be able to complete
and try that spell I just read about...

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.380
Daddy, that's so rude!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.560
Sorry. But, Amelia...

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.420
...how long do
I have to do this?

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.950
This is the safest
place there is!

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:56.990
The barrier can defend us against
any attack spell they might try.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:01.090
If anything goes wrong, Mr. Zelgadis
is here. And so is Mr. Gourry...

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.730
Okay, leave out Mr. Gourry...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.170
You look bored.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.350
Miss Mazenda!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:31.490
My, I feel so sorry for you.
You seem like...

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.730
...a bird in a cage.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:34.830
What do you want?!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:35.930
Wait!

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:39.370
She can't do anything
while she's in this barrier.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.600
Well, what can I do
for you, Miss Mazenda?

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:48.280
Oh, I was wondering if Your Highness
would like to play a game with me?

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.650
Feel free to join us.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.160
You're all invited
to my game room.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:55.780
What?!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:19.240
Prince Phil! Somebody,
inform Lord Christopher!

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.810
And get a message to
Miss Lina immediately!

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:25.010
Yes, sir!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.430
Welcome, Prince Phil.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:12.030
So, the shady "royal sorcerers"
show their true forms, eh?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.970
And you've also revealed the evil
intentions in your hearts!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:19.270
Now to show you how I'll smash you
with the Hammer of Justice!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.610
Our true forms, you say?

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.480
Surely THIS "true form"...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.180
...is more along the
lines you were expecting.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.950
So, you are Monsters.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:46.030
Now, then... Let's begin the game.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:49.430
A game where you
play for your lives...

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:59.210
I'm almost to the last page.
The last part of the spell...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.150
Now I'll have the
secret of that spell!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.360
Just when I was so excited...
and I can't read it.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:22.560
Oh, these are my scribble drawings
I drew when I was three!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.700
They make me feel sorta nostalgic...
Tee-hee.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.740
Tee-hee MY ASS!

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.710
Miss Kira, you're
such a sweet little imp.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.180
No, she ISN'T!!!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:36.310
What's the big idea?! Just when I was
so excited and so filled...

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.320
...with expectation I can't even
read the darned thing!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.450
I don't know what this is all
about, but too bad for you!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:50.420
What are you talking about?
C'mon, gimme that back!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.030
Now that I have this
manuscript thing, it's mine!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.130
If you want it back, you'll
have to make a donation...

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.040
...to the Zoamelgustar
resurrection fund!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.900
I guess I have no choice...

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:04.910
Just wait a little, Great Zoamelgustar!
The dawn of your resurrection is near!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.120
Ow! How dare you!

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:19.520
Lina, I'll get you for this!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.660
It wasn't me...
You don't believe me, do you?

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:24.390
Fine, believe what you want.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:26.900
Oh! What's that?

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.070
A fire sign, I'd say.

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.230
Phil!

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.450
How long can you
hold out, I wonder?

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.320
Rah Tilt!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.960
Daddy!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.660
Don't let 'em lay
a finger on Phil!

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:56.890
Thank you, Gourry.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.060
Anyway, let's get out of here!

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:00.790
Right!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.000
Huh? But how do we get out of here?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.270
"Controller of destiny!
You who must come! You who goes!"

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:13.310
"Join yourself to me
and obey my will!"

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.280
"Come to me!"

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:19.480
A spell of summoning? Of course!
Like what Miss Lina did before!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.880
"Come forth, my ally!"

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.650
lmpossible!
The field didn't break!

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:34.130
Weren't expecting that,
were you, boy?

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.280
There's an emergency in Seyruun?

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:52.450
I told them to contact me in
case anything happened to Phil.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:59.460
Well, then, we'd best hurry.
Right, Miss Martina?

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.930
R- Right...

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:12.900
What did I do to deserve this?!
Curse you, Lina!

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.610
Wait for me, guys!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:49.510
Oh, my... This certainly
complicates things, doesn't it?

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.550
Don't say that
with such a calm face!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.520
S- Sure...

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:59.690
Why... me... damn you... Lina...

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:05.960
You know how important
this is! Do something!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.000
Calm down...

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:09.160
Here's my chance.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:13.300
Damn it, and we're so
close to Seyruun, too.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:16.040
Lina! Prepare to die!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:36.020
CURSE YOU, LINA!!!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.470
Oh, my... She was swept away.

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:47.830
That's it!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.780
Damn! She can take that level of
attack without batting an eye!

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.720
No matter what,
we've gotta hold out!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.120
At least until
Lina can get back here!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:04.150
So, Lina, what are
you going to do?

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.730
I'm gonna do THIS!

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:20.100
I see. If you go that way,
you'll be in Seyruun in no time.

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:23.270
Take care, Lina.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.140
Martina!

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.420
L- Lina!
You came to save me?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:40.390
Oh, did I hit you?
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.030
Why, you...
You heartless, gutless!

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.690
Fireball!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.240
My power's back!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.170
Why does this always happen?!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.820
L- Levitation!

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.850
I did it! It's working!

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:15.960
I should have known it
wouldn't work! Damn it!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.870
How could this have happened?!

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:27.170
My brother has vanished!
This is YOUR failure!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.670
Father!
You shouldn't say that now...

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.280
What is it?!
What's happening?!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.720
Interference from subspace.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.220
Miss Lina!

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.550
Sorry I'm late.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.660
What happened to you?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.260
Oh, this and that.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.930
Guys, you all must
be fighting in there.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:05.210
You're almost to
your limit, aren't you?

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.180
Heh... Don't worry
yourself on our account!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.120
Elmekia Lance!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.170
There! You can't take any more!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:30.830
Amelia!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.870
Phil!

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:42.070
Oh, no! Don't look away from me!
Let's have even more fun!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.950
Miss Lina, please hurry
and save my brother!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:53.520
Christopher... If you're behind
this, you're a really good actor.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.460
Besides that...

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.060
For someone to have broken through
this magic circle here in Seyruun...

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.070
...and then create a subspace
barrier that Zel can't break...

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.100
...means normal
spells won't work on it.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:07.470
Something in here must be
reinforcing the barrier field.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:10.440
Where is it?

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.350
There it is!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.960
So, at last you figured it out.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.360
I thought it was you, Kanzel!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.430
But I'm afraid
you're a bit too late.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.030
The game is nearly over.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:41.600
Is it now? If I smash that goddess
statue and pull them out of there...

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.640
...the game goes into overtime.

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:46.210
Useless boasting...

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:49.740
Your magic still hasn't
fully returned, has it?

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.980
Never underestimate Lina Inverse!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.320
"Lord of Darkness
of the Four Worlds!"

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:05.300
"I call upon you! Grant me all
the power that you possess!"

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.130
Ah, talismen... Magic amplifiers...

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.200
Fire... BALL!

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.620
In the end, even with magic amplifiers,
all you could do was singe it.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.060
A valiant effort, though.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:34.930
Here's a present to you all
to reward your bravery!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.530
Gourry!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.690
Brother!

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.300
How do you like it? The voices of your
friends as they approach death!

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.470
Oh? You still stand
after all I've done to you?

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:57.610
You bet! If we started begging
for mercy from just this...

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:00.850
...we'd never be able to face Lina!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.120
Guys...

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.860
Yes...
This pain, this suffering...

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.330
This is the greatest joy we can know.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.700
The only thing I can
do now is try that spell...

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:27.140
It may not be perfected, I don't
know if I can fully control it...

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.240
...but I'll risk my destiny
for one moment of magic!

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.590
And just what do you
think you can do now?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.780
"Sword of the cold, dark void..."

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.050
"...free yourself from
the heavens' bonds!"

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.290
"Become one with my power,
one with my body..."

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.830
"...and let us walk the path
of destruction together."

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.890
What spell is this?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.730
"Power that can smash even
the souls of the gods!"

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:54.200
The secret attack spell!
One that draws its power from...

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:58.210
...the lord of all Dark Lords:
the Lord of Nightmares!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.250
The Sword of Darkness, which can
cut down the gods themselves!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.370
You mean?!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.320
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.820
You had me scared for a moment.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:28.270
I knew it!
I still can't control it!

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:31.040
What?

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.960
It's time we ended this.

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.870
We're back!

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:02.930
You accursed Monsters!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.810
Guys!

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.320
- Lina!
- Miss Lina!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.150
Brother... Thank
goodness you're all right!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.820
Ah, Christopher!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.690
Wh- What's happening?!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.790
We'll take Prince Phil,
if you don't mind.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.060
Daddy!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.470
Kanzel!

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:35.940
If you wish to have him back,
then be prepared not to flee from us!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.680
Brother!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:50.480
Taking Phil hostage...
What are they up to?

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.050
Now that you mention it, yeah!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:56.660
It means... Phil wasn't
their true target after all!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.690
Then who are they after?!

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.360
That's right.
Their real target isn't Phil...

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.960
It's me!
